==Trivia==
*This is the third collaboration to involve 3 different games/media, the first was Battle Cats x [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event|Million Arthur]] x [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event|Dragon Poker]] and the second was Battle Cats x [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event|Nebaaru-kun]] x [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event|Nyanpazuru]].
*Although the first collab never appeared outside of the Taiwanese version, there are still translated stage names for both stages in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]].
**Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Red Line is translated to Kaohsiung MRT Red Line (高雄MRT レッドライン) .
**Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Orange Line is translated to Kaohsiung MRT Orange Line (高雄MRT オレンジライン).

